{title: Aur Aahista Kijiye Baatein}
{artist: Pankaj Udhas}
{key: D#}

{c: Verse 1}
Aur [D#]aahista kijiye [Cm]baatein,        dhad [D#]kanein koyi sun [A#]raha hoga
Lafz [G#]girne na paayein hothon [A#]se,        waqt [D#]ke haath inko [A#]chun lenge
Kaan [D#]rakhte hai ye dar- [A#]o-deewaar,        raaz [G#]ki saari baat sun [A#]lenge
Aur [D#]aahista kijiye baatein,        Aise [G#]bolo ki dil ka [D#]afsana,
dil [G#]sune aur nigaah [D#]dohraaye,        [D#]Apne chaaron taraf ki yeh [A#]duniya,
[C#]saans [D#]ka [A#]shor [D#]bhi,        [D#]na sun paaye..Na sun paaye
Aur [D#]aahista kijiye [Cm]baatein...        Aaj [g]itne kareeb [D#]aa jao,
doori [g]yon ka kahin ni [D#]shaan na rahe,        [D#]Aise ek doosre mein gum [A#]ho jaaye,
[C#]faas [D#]la [A#]koyi darmi [D#]yaan,        [D#]na reh jaaye..Na reh jaaye
Aur [D#]aahista kijiye [Cm]baatein...
